**Technical Description**: The code does not validate or sanitize user inputs before using them in `Runtime.exec()` or reflection calls, which could lead to remote code execution. If the attacker can control any of the input parameters passed to a method that executes code or uses reflection, they could execute arbitrary commands on the device.
